  "body": "Two installed-layout guards found while syncing the Hermes plugin's vendored runtime:\n\n1. **adopt_semantic_memory** hardcoded `<root>/src/mantle/...` paths for the receipt hashes. In a vendored runtime (`<plugin>/runtime/mantle`) those files don't exist \u2192 GRIMOIRE-ENC-14 crashed with FileNotFoundError. Now resolves the hashed files from the implementing modules (layout-agnostic) and records the companion doc with a presence flag.\n\n2. **DOCTOR-1** detected 'repository checkout' by README.md alone. A vendored plugin dir has a README but no THREAT_MODEL.md \u2192 repo-coherence checks ran against a partial tree and failed. The guard now requires BOTH README.md and THREAT_MODEL.md.\n\nVerified: `python -m mantle prove` = 186/186 under the repo checkout AND under the vendored plugin runtime.",
